{"level":"debug","node":"System","module":"IngestionEPSFetcher","type":"debug","time":"2025-11-13T12:08:02+05:30","message":"Running ClickHouse query:\n\n\t\tSELECT\n\t\t\t`table`,\n\t\t\tavg(eps) AS avg_eps\n\t\tFROM\n\t\t(\n\t\t\tSELECT\n\t\t\t\t`table`,\n\t\t\t\ttoStartOfMinute(event_time) AS minute,\n\t\t\t\tsum(rows) / 60 AS eps\n\t\t\tFROM system.part_log\n\t\t\tWHERE\n\t\t\t\tevent_type = 'NewPart'\n\t\t\t\tAND event_time >= toDateTime('2025-11-11 13:05:07')\n\t\t\t\tAND event_time <= toDateTime('2025-11-11 14:05:08')\n\t\t\t\tAND `table` IN ('vmetrics_linux_monitor_additional_metrics_data','vmetrics_linux_monitor_process_metrics_data','vmetrics_linux_monitor_resource_metrics_data','vmetrics_linux_monitor_storage_metrics_data')\n\t\t\tGROUP BY\n\t\t\t\tminute, `table`\n\t\t)\n\t\tGROUP BY\n\t\t\t`table`\n\t\tORDER BY\n\t\t\tavg_eps DESC\n\t"}
